    "text": "By Forrest Jones, Northeast Arkansas News ,\n1 days ago The Crystal Bridges Museum of American Art and the Momentary in Bentonville have announced their comprehensive 2026 exhibition schedule, designed to celebrate the American spirit through diverse artistic lenses. Crystal Bridges will host three major shows: America 250: Common Threads in March, which will examine 250 years of American art... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
